  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.28,
      516.19,
      549.78,
      585.66
    ],
    "text": "DUE to financial misappropriation and anti-constitutional affairs of the Steering Committee, including the President, Vice President, Secretary and the Treasurer of Railway Daily - paid Benevolent Association, elected at the 46th Anniversary, held on 24.07.2022, the said steering committee is dispersed by the order of the letter of the Secretary to the Ministry of Transport and Highways, bearing the number MT/03/05/21/17-1 and dated of 15.02.2024 as per the authority of the Secretary to the Ministry of Transport and Highways pursuant to the clause 30A(1) in the aforesaid Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.28,
      596.19,
      507.68,
      609.66
    ],
    "text": "A special committee with the following members will be appointed pursuant to the clause 30A(1) in the said Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
